sg-shell (0.1.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sg-gpresult: a Group Policy result tool (like `gpresult /r`) that reports
    the machine and user policy in force, read from the live registry; a console
    program, `gpresult.exe` via App Paths. Gated by test/gpresult-check.sh,
    which plants known machine and user policies and requires them in the report.

 -- Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:02:19 -0700

sg-shell (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Control Panel (sg-control): shows the machine's real state; control.exe
    maps to it and the Start menu lists it.
  * sg-start honours machine Group Policy (NoClose, StartMenuLogOff).

